error[MR0207]: a positional argument after a named one
 --> tests/ui/calls/named_arguments.mr:6:31
  |
6 | let c = Greet(greeting: "Hi", "Ada"); //~ ERROR MR0207
  |                               ^^^^^ name this argument too, or move it before the named ones
  |
  = note: arguments come by position first; after the first named one, every argument is named, each name once

error[MR0207]: the argument `name` is named twice
